OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 29 JAN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,9,     GWales and conductor Ryan Bancroft
OL,10,     Gperform Sibelius's 5th Symphony,
OL,11,     GIda Moberg's Sunrise Suite, and
OL,12,     GBen Goldscheider joins them for
OL,13,     Ghorn concerti.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: On Disappointment
OL,15,     GRachel Cooke looks at the
OL,16,     Gdisappointments which seem to be
OL,17,     Gbuilt into political life and
OL,18,     Gaffectionately recalls her own
OL,19,     Gthwarted political efforts,
OL,20,     Gduring her student days.
