OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 29 JAN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto presents an optimistic
OL,12,     Gtrack from the British jazz soul
OL,13,     Gtrio The Peddlers.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GSpanish soprano Serena Saenz
OL,16,     Gperforms with Vespres d'Arnadi
OL,17,     Gand harpsichordist and conductor
OL,18,     GDani Espasa at the Palau de la
OL,19,     GMusica Catalana in Barcelona.
